+### Integrative Human Microbiome Project
+
+`r BiocStyle::Biocpkg("HMP2Data")` provides 16S rRNA sequencing data from the
+second phase of the Human Microbiome Project, also known as the Integrative
+Human Microbiome Project [@HMP2data]. Additional data, *e.g.* cytokines, are
+included when available. The data are offered as `SummarizedExperiment` and
+`MultiAssayExperiment` objects.
+
+### Microbiome benchmark data
+
+`r BiocStyle::Biocpkg("MicrobiomeBenchmarkData")` provides datasets with a
+known biological ground truth [@Gamboa-Tuz2025]. The datasets were compiled
+for benchmarking differential abundance methods, but the ground truth can be
+useful for other benchmarking applications as well. The datasets are offered
+directly as `TreeSE` objects.
+
 ### Other data sources
 
-The current collections provide access to vast microbiome data
-resources. The output has to be converted into `TreeSE/MAE` separately.
-
-- `r BiocStyle::Biocpkg("MGnifyR")` provides access to
-[EBI/MGnify](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/metagenomics/)
-- `r BiocStyle::Biocpkg("HoloFoodR")` provides access to
-[EBI/HoloFood](https://www.holofooddata.org/)
-- `r BiocStyle::Githubpkg("cran/qiitr")` provides access to
-[QIITA](https://qiita.com/about)
-- `r BiocStyle::Githubpkg("jbisanz/qiime2R")` provides access to
-[QIIME2](https://amplicon-docs.qiime2.org/en/latest//)
+The following packages provide access to further microbiome data resources
+and return the data as `TreeSE` or `MAE` objects.
+
+| Package | Resource |
+|---------|----------|
+| `r BiocStyle::Biocpkg("MGnifyR")` | [EBI/MGnify](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/metagenomics/) |
+| `r BiocStyle::Biocpkg("HoloFoodR")` | [EBI/HoloFood](https://www.holofooddata.org/) |
+| `r BiocStyle::Githubpkg("jbisanz/qiime2R")` | [QIIME2](https://amplicon-docs.qiime2.org/en/latest/) |
 
